# Tarjama does NOT use server-side environment variables.
# All API keys are stored client-side in the user's browser (localStorage).
# This file is intentionally empty — it exists to document that no .env secrets are needed.
#
# The app is a static SPA (Single Page Application).
# API calls go directly from the browser to the LLM provider (Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini).
# No backend server is involved.
